    {
      "duration_ms": 9000,
      "caption": "Shared locks allow many readers; exclusive locks allow one writer.",
      "narration": "Transactions take shared locks to read and exclusive locks to write. Shared is compatible with shared, and exclusive conflicts with everything.",
